# Docs and shipping

After a codebase change, update the matching file under `docs/` (or add one) and list it in `markdown_index.md`. Write so a human can set the feature up without this chat.

When the user asks to **git push**, commit only if they also asked to commit (or the commit is required to push new work they just requested), then `git push` to `https://github.com/shermanlao/LEVO`. When they ask to update production / the VPS, SSH in and run `sudo /usr/local/sbin/levo-deploy`. Do not put `.env` or passwords in git.

See `docs/vps-github.md`.
